            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Added</h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Updates install themselves.</b> Superkeys checks superkeys.space once a day and installs new versions in the background, with no Gatekeeper prompt and without losing Accessibility access. Turn it off, or check now, in Settings → General; &quot;Check for Updates…&quot; is also in the menu bar menu. Every update is verified against a signing key before it&#x27;s installed.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Changed</h3>
<ul>
<li>Releases are signed as &quot;Superkeys&quot; instead of &quot;Hypercaps Dev&quot;. Coming from 0.1.0, grant Accessibility once more after upgrading; later updates keep it.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
